#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:115
msgid "Couriers and shipping methods"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Overview section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:117
#, php-format
msgid "Turn a courier on in %s. Its page appears in Couriers and its methods can be added to your shipping zones."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:118
msgid "Add one method per delivery type to a zone: to an office, to a parcel locker and to an address. BOX NOW has one method, for its lockers."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Couriers section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:120
#, php-format
msgid "Enter the login in %s. Demo logins only reach the courier's test system, where nothing is really shipped. If the courier refuses a login, the courier page says so."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:121
msgid "On the courier page, fill in \"Where you send from\" and the sender details. They stay greyed out until the courier accepts the login."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:122
msgid "Without a login, customers can still choose: Econt offices and lockers from Econt's list, Speedy offices on Speedy's map, Pigeon Express offices and lockers and BOX NOW lockers from the lists they publish. Waybills always need one."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:123
msgid "Cities, offices and lockers are kept on your site and refreshed once a week. \"Reload offices and cities\" on a courier page refreshes them at once."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:124
msgid "On each courier page, the account and \"Where you send from\" sit side by side. Less used options are under \"More options\", closed by default."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:126
msgid "Shipping prices"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:127
msgid "With a login, the courier calculates each price with your contract. Without one, or when the courier does not answer, the courier's public price list is used. You can edit it on the courier page and compare it with the courier website."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:128
msgid "To compare, open the courier page and press \"Check the courier website\" in \"Public prices\". You see what changed, and new prices are filled in only when you choose. It also checks once a week by itself."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:129
msgid "\"Public prices\" shows only when \"Use public prices\" is ticked on the courier page."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:130
msgid "Each shipping method in a zone can have a free shipping amount and a fixed price."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:131
msgid "\"Customer pays the courier\" on an Econt, Speedy or Pigeon Express method in a zone lists the payment methods for which the customer pays the delivery to the courier on delivery. The checkout then shows the price for information, not in the total, and the waybill says the receiver pays. With any other payment method you collect the delivery in the total and the sender pays. BOX NOW cannot charge the customer, so you always collect it there."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:132
msgid "The total follows the payment method the customer picks at checkout. The courier box on the order screen can still change who pays for one waybill."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:133
msgid "New Econt, Speedy and Pigeon Express methods start with cash on delivery in \"Customer pays the courier\". A cart whose goods cost nothing is always yours to collect."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:134
msgid "In the courier box of an order whose customer pays the courier, a waybill paid by the sender changes nothing: you pay the courier. A fixed price you collect in the cash on delivery amount makes it an order you collected once the courier accepts the waybill, while it has no documents; a later waybill paid by the receiver puts it back. Once the order has documents, a fixed price waybill is refused. Choosing the receiver as payer on an order you collected shows a warning."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:135
msgid "Review or test before payment is set on the courier method in the shipping zone and goes on every label. For Pigeon Express choose review or test; the order screen can change it for one label."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:136
msgid "When a courier publishes new prices, a notice says so. Save that courier's prices or press Dismiss."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:138
msgid "Shipping abroad"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:139
msgid "Your store is always in Bulgaria. Only the customer may be abroad. Turn on \"Ship abroad\" on the courier method in the shipping zone, for each courier you want to use."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:140
msgid "Econt delivers to Romania and Greece. Speedy delivers to Romania, Greece, Cyprus, Hungary, the Czech Republic, Croatia, Poland, Slovakia and Slovenia. Other countries are not offered."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:141
msgid "Add the countries to the shipping zone as usual. Customers there choose the office, locker or address as at home."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:142
msgid "Prices abroad come only from the courier's live calculation, so a courier login is needed. The public price list is for Bulgaria only and is never used abroad. If there is no courier data for the order, the customer sees no price."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:143
msgid "If the customer has chosen no office, locker or address, the checkout says \"Please fill in your delivery address.\""
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:144
msgid "\"Free shipping over\" is for Bulgaria. For other countries use \"Free shipping over, abroad\" and write the country code and the total, for example RO=150, GR=200. A country that is not listed gets no free shipping. BG is not allowed in this field."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:145
msgid "Pigeon Express gives no price for a parcel over 30 kg."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:148
msgid "Works with the classic checkout, the block checkout and checkout pages made with a page builder, including step-by-step checkouts."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:149
msgid "When the customer picks a courier, they choose an office, a locker or an address right under it, from a list or on the courier's map. Until then the option says \"Complete the fields to calculate\"."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Checkout section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:151
#, php-format
msgid "In %s > Checkout fields you set the order, Required, Optional or Hidden and the width of every field, and add your own fields."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:152
msgid "The Condition dropdown of a field shows or hides it by the value of other fields (is, is not, greater, less, empty, not empty). Conditions in one group all have to be true (and); \"Add alternative (or)\" adds another group, and one true group is enough (or). Example: for a \"Company\" field pick \"Show when...\", then \"Invoice for a company\" \"is\" \"Yes\". \"Always shown\" removes the rule. The classic checkout follows every condition; the block checkout follows conditions on your own fields that read your own fields (not greater or less)."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:153
msgid "Using WooCommerce Checkout Field Editor (free or Pro) before? \"Import fields from Checkout Field Editor\" copies its fields, rules and field conditions. Cart, product and repeat rules are left out and counted in the notice. Company invoice fields stay with Nashenski. The block checkout applies field conditions to the extra fields only, and not the \"greater\" and \"less\" ones."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:154
msgid "\"Shipping options look\" sets cards, buttons side by side or the plain look of your theme. \"Colours and sizes\" holds the colours, borders, corners and spacing. Empty settings follow your design tokens or theme."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:155
msgid "\"Free shipping hint\" shows \"Free shipping over\" and the total under each option that is not free yet. \"Free shipping progress bar\" shows above the options how much more the customer needs to buy. Both use the \"Free shipping over\" total of the shipping methods."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:157 app/Admin/class-setup-wizard.php:390 app/Admin/class-setup-wizard.php:622 app/Export/Builder/class-fields.php:122
msgid "VAT"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:158
msgid "Registered for VAT: the setup turns WooCommerce taxes on, shows prices with VAT and adds a 20% rate for Bulgaria, shipping included."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:159
msgid "Some goods at 9%: the tax class \"Reduced rate\" also gets a 9% rate. Set that tax class on those products."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:160
msgid "Not registered for VAT: the setup turns WooCommerce taxes off. Your tax rates are kept."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:162
msgid "Waybills, couriers and order statuses"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:163
msgid "The \"Courier choice\" box on every order shows the courier, the delivery type and the chosen office, locker or address. It is only for reading."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:164
msgid "Open an order to create, update, print or cancel its waybill in the courier box."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:165
msgid "In the \"Order actions\" box of an order, and in the bulk actions of the orders list: \"Create waybill\" makes the waybill from the customer's choices, \"Request a courier\" books a pickup with Econt or Speedy for all the chosen waybills, \"Check the shipment now\" reads the status from the courier."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:166
msgid "Print the label from the order or from the orders list. Where a courier offers several print sizes, such as A4 or A6 for Speedy, choose one first."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:167
msgid "Econt courier requests skip weekends and holidays by themselves. Speedy picks the next possible day."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:168
msgid "Speedy: the city and region of a waybill come from the order's address. In the street box, type in Bulgarian or Latin letters; the list shows Speedy's streets and quarters for that city."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:169
msgid "\"Generate label after checkout\" on a courier page makes the waybill as soon as an order is placed."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Overview section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:171
#, php-format
msgid "In %s > Waybills and order statuses: put the order number on the waybill, and choose the status orders get when the parcel is delivered or goes back to you. Open orders are checked every hour."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:172
msgid "Customers see \"Track your parcel\" with the waybill number on their order page, and get it in the order emails."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:174 app/Admin/class-settings-page.php:165 app/Admin/Tabs/class-quick-order-tab.php:23 app/Admin/Tabs/class-quick-order-tab.php:119 app/Admin/Tabs/class-settings-tab.php:41 app/Front_End/class-quick-order.php:339
msgid "Quick order"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:175
msgid "Turn it on in WooCommerce > Settings > Nashenski Commerce > Quick order. A \"Quick order\" button then shows on the product page and/or the cart, for shoppers who do not want to go through checkout."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:176
msgid "Choose how the form opens (dialog, inline or side panel) and its fields: a ready-made template or a Custom one. Name, phone and email are always asked, and only Bulgarian phone numbers are accepted."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:177
msgid "Each submission becomes an order with the status \"Quick order\". No stock is reserved and no payment link is sent until you change the status. You get the WooCommerce \"New order\" email."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:178
msgid "To ship it, open the order. In the Delivery box choose the shipping option, the town and the office, locker or address, then press \"Save delivery\". The courier box for the label appears, and the price comes when the label is made. The customer then gets an email with the delivery price and the new total."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:179
msgid "For Econt, once the delivery is saved, the label button in the orders list also makes the label."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:182
msgid "Turn it on in WooCommerce > Settings > Nashenski Commerce > Abandoned carts. It is off by default."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:183
msgid "It keeps the carts that were not ordered and records the email as soon as the shopper types it, even at checkout without an account. Mention this in your privacy policy."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:184
msgid "Set when the reminders go out (by default 1, 24 and 72 hours after the last change, at most three, only between 08:00 and 22:00) and whether each cart gets a single-use coupon. Edit the \"Abandoned cart reminder\" email in WooCommerce > Settings > Emails."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:185
msgid "The link in the email refills the cart. Every email has an unsubscribe link, and a shopper who unsubscribes gets no more reminders."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:186
msgid "See the carts in WooCommerce > Abandoned carts. Filter them by status, send a reminder by hand or delete carts. Old carts are deleted once the retention period ends."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:188 app/Admin/Tabs/class-nra-tab.php:309
msgid "Invoices and documents"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:189
msgid "The order document is made for every order. Invoices are made as set in \"When to generate invoices?\", and credit notes for refunds."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:190
msgid "To make an invoice by hand, open the order and use \"Make invoice\" in the PDF Files box. You can change the number; the next automatic number continues after it."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Documents section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:192
#, php-format
msgid "The look of the PDF files (logo, colours, font, spacing) is in %s > PDF appearance. Every document is made in Bulgarian and in English."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Documents section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:194
#, php-format
msgid "Your company details, the numbering and when documents are made are in %s > Company details and Invoices and documents."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:195
msgid "To save disk space, set \"Delete order documents after (days)\" in Documents > Invoices and documents. Only the order document PDFs of older orders are deleted; invoices, credit notes and refund documents stay. \"Delete all order documents now\" does it at once, after a confirmation."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Documents section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:197
#, php-format
msgid "In %s > Company invoice, \"Company invoice fields\" adds \"I want an invoice for a company\" with company name, EIK, VAT number, MOL, town and address."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Documents section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:199
#, php-format
msgid "In %s > Invoices and documents, \"Invoice numbering\": \"Website invoices\" go into the NRA audit file. \"Own invoicing program\" keeps the invoice out of it; you type that program's number on the order."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:200
msgid "Copies can go to your accountant by email, and the monthly NRA audit file too."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:201
msgid "A delivery with no VAT, on an order with no VAT at all, is printed at 0% with its full price."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:202
msgid "A delivery the customer paid to the courier is not on the documents or in the NRA audit file, because you did not collect it. Credit notes follow their order. Each order keeps what was decided at checkout; orders from before version 0.21.8 keep the old \"Remove delivery from documents\" rule."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:203
msgid "Quick orders and orders made on the order screen are decided the same way once they have a shipping method and a payment method, and again when either changes, until the order has documents. A waybill made there for an order whose customer pays the courier shows its price for information only."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:204
msgid "Shipping methods of other plugins keep \"Is ... courier?\" in Documents > Shipping on documents: with cash on delivery, their delivery is left out of documents and the NRA audit file."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:205
msgid "When the payment method of a checkout order is changed on the order screen, who pays the courier stays as decided at checkout, and a notice asks you to check the delivery line and the waybill by hand."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:207
msgid "NRA audit file and exports"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Exports section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:209
#, php-format
msgid "%s has the NRA audit file (Ordinance N-18), the invoice archive and the Microinvest Delta file for a chosen month. The audit file is checked against the NRA schema and has no order limit."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:210
msgid "Choose the month and press \"Create XML file\" for the NRA, \"Download archive\" for the invoices or \"Create file\" for Delta."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:211
msgid "The created files are kept for 7 days, then deleted. Download them when you create them."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:212
msgid "The custom export takes orders, products sold or documents, with your filters, columns and order, as CSV, Excel, JSON or XML. Save an export to run it again next month."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:214
msgid "EU VAT number check"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:215
msgid "Turn on \"Enable VIES validation\" in Documents > Invoices and documents. A company customer's VAT number is then checked with the European VIES system when the order is placed."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:216
msgid "An error shows only when the number is not valid or when the check itself fails. The option needs the PHP SOAP extension on your server."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:217
msgid "The VAT number is optional at checkout. Tick \"VAT number required on checkout?\" in Documents to make company customers enter it."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:219 app/Front_End/class-withdrawal.php:569 app/Front_End/class-withdrawal.php:583
msgid "EU withdrawal function"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: link to the Checkout section
#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:221
#, php-format
msgid "Turn it on in %s > EU withdrawal function. A \"Withdraw from contract here\" link appears at the bottom of every page, on each order in My Account and in the order emails."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:222
msgid "Place the link yourself with the shortcode [nashenski_withdrawal_link] (button=\"yes\" makes it a button)."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:223
msgid "The links are not shown inside page-builder editors (Bricks, Oxygen, Breakdance, Elementor, Etch and others), only on the live site. A shortcode you place yourself still shows there."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:224
msgid "Requests show in the orders list (\"Withdrawal\" column) and on the order, with everything the customer submitted."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:226 app/Admin/class-settings-page.php:177 app/Admin/Tabs/class-settings-tab.php:72 app/Reports/class-reports.php:167
msgid "Customer checks"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:227
msgid "nekorekten.com, Connectix and NepoStop tell you whether a phone number has a history of refused parcels. Nashenski Commerce can show a warning on the order and hide cash on delivery for such customers."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:228
msgid "In NepoStop and nekorekten.com you can also tick the payment methods to hide under \"Hide these payment methods\". When the service flags the customer at its level of warning, those payment methods are not offered at checkout."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:229
msgid "Each visitor address gets at most 20 phone checks an hour. Over that, the check is skipped and the checkout goes on."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:230
msgid "Turn a service on in Overview, save, then enter its API key or token in Customer checks. A service without a key is not asked."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:231
msgid "On the order, the Reports box shows the answers. Press \"Refresh data\" to ask again."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:232
msgid "For nekorekten.com you can report a customer yourself: write what happened and press \"Send report\". The report carries the name, phone and email of the order. Change the text and press \"Save report\", or press \"Delete report\" to remove it from nekorekten.com."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:233
msgid "Connectix and NepoStop can also get tracking information or labels from your orders. Both are optional."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:235 app/Admin/class-impossiblevatprice.php:46 app/Admin/class-impossiblevatprice.php:47 app/Admin/class-impossiblevatprice.php:128
msgid "Mathematically impossible prices"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:236
msgid "Open Products > Mathematically impossible prices and press \"Scan products\". It lists the prices that cannot be split into a price without VAT and the VAT without rounding."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:237
msgid "Press \"Fix all\" to correct them. The check matters most when your prices are entered including tax."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:239 app/Admin/class-help-page.php:288
msgid "Moving from another plugin"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:240
msgid "Nashenski Commerce imports from Bulgarisation for WooCommerce, the mreja.net plugins (Econt Express, BOX NOW Delivery, Speedy shipping method, Pigeon Express shipping, Ordinance N-18), Drusoft Shipping for Econt and for Speedy, Econt Delivery and Speedy Shipping."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:241
msgid "The order documents and invoices of Bulgarisation for WooCommerce move into the private documents folder and open from the order as before."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:242
msgid "It takes over the courier logins, sender details, the waybill numbers of your orders, the shipping zone methods with the mreja.net free shipping totals and, from the N-18 plugin, the company details and document numbers. Then deactivate the old plugin on the Plugins screen. Its own data stays in the database."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:243
msgid "While Bulgarisation for WooCommerce (4.x or 5.x) is active, Nashenski Commerce is paused. Deactivate it before the import."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:244
msgid "Import the mreja.net Ordinance N-18 plugin while it is off. Until its documents are imported, Nashenski Commerce makes no invoices or other documents while a new number could clash with one of them. If it is turned on again after the import, it can reuse numbers Nashenski Commerce already gave out: documents pause until it is off and its import is run again. Correct the orders that import lists, then use \"Regenerate PDF's\" for orders without documents."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:245
msgid "Econt Delivery and Drusoft Shipping for Econt use a different Econt key: enter your Econt username and password after the import."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:246
msgid "Only users who can manage plugins see the import button. If an old document number clashes with a number already in use, that number is skipped and the summary says \"N document numbers skipped (conflict)\"."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:248
msgid "Command line (WP-CLI)"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:249
msgid "Settings can be read and changed with WP-CLI: wp nashenski setting list, get, set and reset. The names are the option names without \"nashenski_settings_\", for example apis_enable_econt."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:250
msgid "Save a password from standard input so it stays out of the shell history: echo \"$PASSWORD\" | wp nashenski setting set econt_password -"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:251
msgid "wp nashenski courier reload and check do the \"Reload offices and cities\" button and the login check of a courier."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:253
msgid "Updates"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:254
msgid "New versions show up in Dashboard > Updates and on the Plugins screen, like any other plugin update. Automatic updates can be turned on there too."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:256
msgid "When something does not work"
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:257
msgid "\"Nothing found\" under a courier: check the login on the courier page. In BOX NOW demo mode there are only two test lockers, both in Sofia."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:258
msgid "No courier options at checkout: add the methods to the shipping zone of the customer's address and give your products a weight."
msgstr ""

#: app/Admin/class-help-page.php:259
msgid "\"Complete the fields to calculate\" does not go away: the customer has not chosen an office, a locker or an address yet."
